%YAML 1.1
%TAG !u! tag:unity3d.com,2011:
--- !u!114 &11400000
MonoBehaviour:
  m_ObjectHideFlags: 0
  m_CorrespondingSourceObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabInstance: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabAsset: {fileID: 0}
  m_GameObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_Enabled: 1
  m_EditorHideFlags: 0
  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: 51fb4c6070f247e48b4377b5728b8182, type: 3}
  m_Name: S10_7
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Assembly-CSharp::StoryScene
  sentences:
  - text: When we arrive at the bottom, I'm taken aback at how large the space is.
    alternativeText: 
    character: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 221cb615d975cab419307e866ebd5c5c, type: 2}
    actions: []
    music: {fileID: 0}
    sound: {fileID: 0}
  - text: It's much bigger than the living space above.
    alternativeText: 
    character: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 4849dc22c0fc77f45b58cdfcf9fc156e, type: 2}
    actions: []
    music: {fileID: 0}
    sound: {fileID: 0}
  - text: I also notice some doors that suggest that there are more rooms down here.
    alternativeText: 
    character: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 221cb615d975cab419307e866ebd5c5c, type: 2}
    actions: []
    music: {fileID: 0}
    sound: {fileID: 0}
  - text: In the back of the room I can see a seating area and casually sitting on
      one of the chairs, Scarlet.
    alternativeText: 
    character: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 221cb615d975cab419307e866ebd5c5c, type: 2}
    actions:
    - character: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 9c82936b944e581478f4d23ce326563a, type: 2}
      spriteIndex: 0
      type: 1
      position: {x: 0, y: 0}
      speed: 0
      targetScale: 0
    music: {fileID: 0}
    sound: {fileID: 0}
  - text: "Scarlet! Uh, or should I say Lady\u2026 or, maybe Miss Moon after all?"
    alternativeText: 
    character: {fileID: 11400000, guid: d69d53562766de143bf061768e3de597, type: 2}
    actions: []
    music: {fileID: 0}
    sound: {fileID: 0}
  - text: Scarlet shows a relieved smile.
    alternativeText: 
    character: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 221cb615d975cab419307e866ebd5c5c, type: 2}
    actions:
    - character: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 9c82936b944e581478f4d23ce326563a, type: 2}
      spriteIndex: 0
      type: 0
      position: {x: 0, y: 0}
      speed: 0
      targetScale: 0
    music: {fileID: 0}
    sound: {fileID: 0}
  - text: You can call me Scarlet. But when we're at the company, please continue
      adressing me as Miss Moon.
    alternativeText: 
    character: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 9c82936b944e581478f4d23ce326563a, type: 2}
    actions:
    - character: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 9c82936b944e581478f4d23ce326563a, type: 2}
      spriteIndex: 0
      type: 0
      position: {x: 0, y: 0}
      speed: 0
      targetScale: 0
    music: {fileID: 0}
    sound: {fileID: 0}
  - text: Right. I'm glad to see you safe and sound. What happened?
    alternativeText: 
    character: {fileID: 11400000, guid: d69d53562766de143bf061768e3de597, type: 2}
    actions: []
    music: {fileID: 0}
    sound: {fileID: 0}
  - text: I'm also glad that you seem safe. after that cloaked person dragged you
      into a dark portal and vanished with you, I got zapped back to the present
      and landed right where we fell down in my office. It didn't seem like any time
      passed.
    alternativeText: 
    character: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 9c82936b944e581478f4d23ce326563a, type: 2}
    actions:
    - character: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 9c82936b944e581478f4d23ce326563a, type: 2}
      spriteIndex: 0
      type: 0
      position: {x: 0, y: 0}
      speed: 0
      targetScale: 0
    music: {fileID: 0}
    sound: {fileID: 0}
  - text: She pauses.
    alternativeText: 
    character: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 221cb615d975cab419307e866ebd5c5c, type: 2}
    actions: []
    music: {fileID: 0}
    sound: {fileID: 0}
  - text: But are you sure you're not hurt? let me see.
    alternativeText: 
    character: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 9c82936b944e581478f4d23ce326563a, type: 2}
    actions:
    - character: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 9c82936b944e581478f4d23ce326563a, type: 2}
      spriteIndex: 3
      type: 0
      position: {x: 0, y: 0}
      speed: 0
      targetScale: 0
    music: {fileID: 0}
    sound: {fileID: 0}
  - text: I walk over to her and let her closely inspect my body.
    alternativeText: 
    character: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 221cb615d975cab419307e866ebd5c5c, type: 2}
    actions: []
    music: {fileID: 0}
    sound: {fileID: 0}
  - text: I'm fine. I managed to escape the Spirit before anything could happen.
      It felt just like when we traveled back in time, I went through a starry void
      and somehow came back again.
    alternativeText: 
    character: {fileID: 11400000, guid: d69d53562766de143bf061768e3de597, type: 2}
    actions: []
    music: {fileID: 0}
    sound: {fileID: 0}
  - text: Scarlet sighs.
    alternativeText: 
    character: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 221cb615d975cab419307e866ebd5c5c, type: 2}
    actions:
    - character: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 9c82936b944e581478f4d23ce326563a, type: 2}
      spriteIndex: 3
      type: 0
      position: {x: 0, y: 0}
      speed: 0
      targetScale: 0
    music: {fileID: 0}
    sound: {fileID: 0}
  - text: That's good then.
    alternativeText: 
    character: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 9c82936b944e581478f4d23ce326563a, type: 2}
    actions:
    - character: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 9c82936b944e581478f4d23ce326563a, type: 2}
      spriteIndex: 0
      type: 0
      position: {x: 0, y: 0}
      speed: 0
      targetScale: 0
    music: {fileID: 0}
    sound: {fileID: 0}
  - text: she nods in the direction of the guys.
    alternativeText: 
    character: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 221cb615d975cab419307e866ebd5c5c, type: 2}
    actions: []
    music: {fileID: 0}
    sound: {fileID: 0}
  - text: Thanks for bringing {playerName} here safely.
    alternativeText: Thanks for bringing them here safely.
    character: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 9c82936b944e581478f4d23ce326563a, type: 2}
    actions:
    - character: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 9c82936b944e581478f4d23ce326563a, type: 2}
      spriteIndex: 0
      type: 0
      position: {x: 0, y: 0}
      speed: 0
      targetScale: 0
    music: {fileID: 0}
    sound: {fileID: 0}
  - text: No biggie! Does that mean we can have an extra pack?
    alternativeText: 
    character: {fileID: 11400000, guid: f5a7c9d1e2b34567890123456789abcd, type: 2}
    actions: []
    music: {fileID: 0}
    sound: {fileID: 0}
  - text: Sure.
    alternativeText: 
    character: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 9c82936b944e581478f4d23ce326563a, type: 2}
    actions:
    - character: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 9c82936b944e581478f4d23ce326563a, type: 2}
      spriteIndex: 0
      type: 0
      position: {x: 0, y: 0}
      speed: 0
      targetScale: 0
    music: {fileID: 0}
    sound: {fileID: 0}
  - text: I see some warmth in Scarlet's eyes.
    alternativeText: 
    character: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 4849dc22c0fc77f45b58cdfcf9fc156e, type: 2}
    actions:
    - character: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 9c82936b944e581478f4d23ce326563a, type: 2}
      spriteIndex: 0
      type: 0
      position: {x: 0, y: 0}
      speed: 0
      targetScale: 0
    music: {fileID: 0}
    sound: {fileID: 0}
  - text: Yayy, don't mind if I do!
    alternativeText: 
    character: {fileID: 11400000, guid: f5a7c9d1e2b34567890123456789abcd, type: 2}
    actions: []
    music: {fileID: 0}
    sound: {fileID: 0}
  - text: Thanks, boss.
    alternativeText: 
    character: {fileID: 11400000, guid: bbccddeeff00112233445566778899aa, type: 2}
    actions: []
    music: {fileID: 0}
    sound: {fileID: 0}
  - text: They head over to the fridge while Lu hesitates.
    alternativeText: 
    character: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 221cb615d975cab419307e866ebd5c5c, type: 2}
    actions: []
    music: {fileID: 0}
    sound: {fileID: 0}
  - text: Go on, Lu. It's okay.
    alternativeText: 
    character: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 9c82936b944e581478f4d23ce326563a, type: 2}
    actions:
    - character: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 9c82936b944e581478f4d23ce326563a, type: 2}
      spriteIndex: 0
      type: 0
      position: {x: 0, y: 0}
      speed: 0
      targetScale: 0
    music: {fileID: 0}
    sound: {fileID: 0}
  - text: Okay. Thank you.
    alternativeText: 
    character: {fileID: 11400000, guid: a7b8c9d0e1f2031445566778899aabbc, type: 2}
    actions: []
    music: {fileID: 0}
    sound: {fileID: 0}
  - text: I see them rummaging in the fridge and take out something that looks a
      little suspicious.
    alternativeText: 
    character: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 221cb615d975cab419307e866ebd5c5c, type: 2}
    actions: []
    music: {fileID: 0}
    sound: {fileID: 0}
  - text: "It's red. Is that\u2026 blood?"
    alternativeText: 
    character: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 4849dc22c0fc77f45b58cdfcf9fc156e, type: 2}
    actions: []
    music: {fileID: 0}
    sound: {fileID: 0}
  - text: "Are those\u2026"
    alternativeText: 
    character: {fileID: 11400000, guid: d69d53562766de143bf061768e3de597, type: 2}
    actions: []
    music: {fileID: 0}
    sound: {fileID: 0}
  - text: Yes. They're blood packs.
    alternativeText: 
    character: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 9c82936b944e581478f4d23ce326563a, type: 2}
    actions:
    - character: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 9c82936b944e581478f4d23ce326563a, type: 2}
      spriteIndex: 0
      type: 0
      position: {x: 0, y: 0}
      speed: 0
      targetScale: 0
    music: {fileID: 0}
    sound: {fileID: 0}
  - text: Then, does that mean they're vampires too?
    alternativeText: 
    character: {fileID: 11400000, guid: d69d53562766de143bf061768e3de597, type: 2}
    actions: []
    music: {fileID: 0}
    sound: {fileID: 0}
  - text: Yes.
    alternativeText: 
    character: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 9c82936b944e581478f4d23ce326563a, type: 2}
    actions:
    - character: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 9c82936b944e581478f4d23ce326563a, type: 2}
      spriteIndex: 0
      type: 0
      position: {x: 0, y: 0}
      speed: 0
      targetScale: 0
    music: {fileID: 0}
    sound: {fileID: 0}
  - text: To be telling me all this and even letting me witness it, it seems like
      Scarlet trusts me quite a bit now.
    alternativeText: 
    character: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 4849dc22c0fc77f45b58cdfcf9fc156e, type: 2}
    actions: []
    music: {fileID: 0}
    sound: {fileID: 0}
  - text: I'm kind of touched.
    alternativeText: 
    character: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 4849dc22c0fc77f45b58cdfcf9fc156e, type: 2}
    actions: []
    music: {fileID: 0}
    sound: {fileID: 0}
  - text: I feel like we've gotten a little closer now.
    alternativeText: 
    character: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 221cb615d975cab419307e866ebd5c5c, type: 2}
    actions: []
    music: {fileID: 0}
    sound: {fileID: 0}
  - text: To be honest with you, there's one more secret I have.
    alternativeText: 
    character: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 9c82936b944e581478f4d23ce326563a, type: 2}
    actions:
    - character: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 9c82936b944e581478f4d23ce326563a, type: 2}
      spriteIndex: 3
      type: 0
      position: {x: 0, y: 0}
      speed: 0
      targetScale: 0
    music: {fileID: 0}
    sound: {fileID: 0}
  - text: Regarding your family?
    alternativeText: 
    character: {fileID: 11400000, guid: d69d53562766de143bf061768e3de597, type: 2}
    actions: []
    music: {fileID: 0}
    sound: {fileID: 0}
  - text: Mhm. They are not really related to me, but we're a bunch of runaway vampires
      with nowhere left to go. And I take care of them. I thought my family was the
      last that remained of the noble vampire bloodline but there are always some
      that manage to survive in secret.
    alternativeText: 
    character: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 9c82936b944e581478f4d23ce326563a, type: 2}
    actions:
    - character: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 9c82936b944e581478f4d23ce326563a, type: 2}
      spriteIndex: 0
      type: 0
      position: {x: 0, y: 0}
      speed: 0
      targetScale: 0
    music: {fileID: 0}
    sound: {fileID: 0}
  - text: That's right. The boss took us in and manages the gang. I'm really grateful,
      cuz without her, we'd still be wandering the streets living off rodent blood.
    alternativeText: 
    character: {fileID: 11400000, guid: f5a7c9d1e2b34567890123456789abcd, type: 2}
    actions: []
    music: {fileID: 0}
    sound: {fileID: 0}
  - text: Gang? Scarlet, you're a gang leader??
    alternativeText: 
    character: {fileID: 11400000, guid: d69d53562766de143bf061768e3de597, type: 2}
    actions: []
    music: {fileID: 0}
    sound: {fileID: 0}
  - text: She looks a bit taken aback.
    alternativeText: 
    character: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 221cb615d975cab419307e866ebd5c5c, type: 2}
    actions:
    - character: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 9c82936b944e581478f4d23ce326563a, type: 2}
      spriteIndex: 1
      type: 0
      position: {x: 0, y: 0}
      speed: 0
      targetScale: 0
    music: {fileID: 0}
    sound: {fileID: 0}
  - text: "We're not really\u2026 I mean, I guess we are an organisation. We collect
      blood in exchange for small favours and distribute it evenly to the members.
      We don't use violence if it can be avoided, though."
    alternativeText: 
    character: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 9c82936b944e581478f4d23ce326563a, type: 2}
    actions:
    - character: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 9c82936b944e581478f4d23ce326563a, type: 2}
      spriteIndex: 3
      type: 0
      position: {x: 0, y: 0}
      speed: 0
      targetScale: 0
    music: {fileID: 0}
    sound: {fileID: 0}
  - text: "Mmh, but sometimes we do gotta beat up some people, Like last tim\u2014"
    alternativeText: 
    character: {fileID: 11400000, guid: f5a7c9d1e2b34567890123456789abcd, type: 2}
    actions: []
    music: {fileID: 0}
    sound: {fileID: 0}
  - text: Seth presses his mouth shut with his hands.
    alternativeText: 
    character: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 221cb615d975cab419307e866ebd5c5c, type: 2}
    actions: []
    music: {fileID: 0}
    sound: {fileID: 0}
  - text: That's about enough from you. Are you asking for a beating from the boss?!
    alternativeText: 
    character: {fileID: 11400000, guid: bbccddeeff00112233445566778899aa, type: 2}
    actions: []
    music: {fileID: 0}
    sound: {fileID: 0}
  - text: Does Scarlet beat them up as well?!
    alternativeText: 
    character: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 4849dc22c0fc77f45b58cdfcf9fc156e, type: 2}
    actions: []
    music: {fileID: 0}
    sound: {fileID: 0}
  - text: I cautiously glance up at Scarlet.
    alternativeText: 
    character: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 221cb615d975cab419307e866ebd5c5c, type: 2}
    actions: []
    music: {fileID: 0}
    sound: {fileID: 0}
  - text: Don't mind them. So, that's all my secrets out in the open now. What about
      you? You mentioned a Spirit earlier.
    alternativeText: 
    character: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 9c82936b944e581478f4d23ce326563a, type: 2}
    actions:
    - character: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 9c82936b944e581478f4d23ce326563a, type: 2}
      spriteIndex: 0
      type: 0
      position: {x: 0, y: 0}
      speed: 0
      targetScale: 0
    music: {fileID: 0}
    sound: {fileID: 0}
  - text: Oh, right. I almost forgot.
    alternativeText: 
    character: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 4849dc22c0fc77f45b58cdfcf9fc156e, type: 2}
    actions: []
    music: {fileID: 0}
    sound: {fileID: 0}
  - text: Yeah, I think the one who kidnapped me was an Interdimensional Spirit.
      I had some nightmares a while back and it turns out, I'm the successor of some
      Sustainer.
    alternativeText: 
    character: {fileID: 11400000, guid: d69d53562766de143bf061768e3de597, type: 2}
    actions: []
    music: {fileID: 0}
    sound: {fileID: 0}
  - text: So, you mean that travelling back and forth in time is like an ability
      of yours?
    alternativeText: 
    character: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 9c82936b944e581478f4d23ce326563a, type: 2}
    actions:
    - character: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 9c82936b944e581478f4d23ce326563a, type: 2}
      spriteIndex: 0
      type: 0
      position: {x: 0, y: 0}
      speed: 0
      targetScale: 0
    music: {fileID: 0}
    sound: {fileID: 0}
  - text: I nod.
    alternativeText: 
    character: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 221cb615d975cab419307e866ebd5c5c, type: 2}
    actions: []
    music: {fileID: 0}
    sound: {fileID: 0}
  - text: And I think I'm supposed to stop the plan of those Spirits and save the
      world or something. I still have to find out the details, though. About their
      plans, and my powers as well.
    alternativeText: 
    character: {fileID: 11400000, guid: d69d53562766de143bf061768e3de597, type: 2}
    actions: []
    music: {fileID: 0}
    sound: {fileID: 0}
  - text: Huh, will you be able to achieve that mission?
    alternativeText: 
    character: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 9c82936b944e581478f4d23ce326563a, type: 2}
    actions:
    - character: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 9c82936b944e581478f4d23ce326563a, type: 2}
      spriteIndex: 0
      type: 0
      position: {x: 0, y: 0}
      speed: 0
      targetScale: 0
    music: {fileID: 0}
    sound: {fileID: 0}
  - text: I guess, I have to. Sorry I dragged you into this mess.
    alternativeText: 
    character: {fileID: 11400000, guid: d69d53562766de143bf061768e3de597, type: 2}
    actions: []
    music: {fileID: 0}
    sound: {fileID: 0}
  - text: No, I could be at fault as well. Because why else did we go back to my
      past specifically?
    alternativeText: 
    character: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 9c82936b944e581478f4d23ce326563a, type: 2}
    actions:
    - character: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 9c82936b944e581478f4d23ce326563a, type: 2}
      spriteIndex: 0
      type: 0
      position: {x: 0, y: 0}
      speed: 0
      targetScale: 0
    music: {fileID: 0}
    sound: {fileID: 0}
  - text: Well, that could be because my mind was so occupied with Scarlet. And I
      think the more this goes on, the more I will drag her into this.
    alternativeText: 
    character: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 4849dc22c0fc77f45b58cdfcf9fc156e, type: 2}
    actions: []
    music: {fileID: 0}
    sound: {fileID: 0}
  - text: I'm sure she doesn't really want to go back to the past with her ex and
      everything. I shouldn't burden her with this.
    alternativeText: 
    character: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 4849dc22c0fc77f45b58cdfcf9fc156e, type: 2}
    actions: []
    music: {fileID: 0}
    sound: {fileID: 0}
  - text: You know, I don't really know what the right course of action should be
      right now. I feel like I need to get to know my mission and powers a bit better.
    alternativeText: 
    character: {fileID: 11400000, guid: d69d53562766de143bf061768e3de597, type: 2}
    actions: []
    music: {fileID: 0}
    sound: {fileID: 0}
  - text: Scarlet looks surprised.
    alternativeText: 
    character: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 221cb615d975cab419307e866ebd5c5c, type: 2}
    actions:
    - character: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 9c82936b944e581478f4d23ce326563a, type: 2}
      spriteIndex: 0
      type: 0
      position: {x: 0, y: 0}
      speed: 0
      targetScale: 0
    music: {fileID: 0}
    sound: {fileID: 0}
  - text: You don't have to struggle alone, I can help you.
    alternativeText: 
    character: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 9c82936b944e581478f4d23ce326563a, type: 2}
    actions:
    - character: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 9c82936b944e581478f4d23ce326563a, type: 2}
      spriteIndex: 0
      type: 0
      position: {x: 0, y: 0}
      speed: 0
      targetScale: 0
    music: {fileID: 0}
    sound: {fileID: 0}
  - text: I feel like you have a lot going on with the company and your gang as well.
      I don't want you to relive your painful past just because of me.
    alternativeText: 
    character: {fileID: 11400000, guid: d69d53562766de143bf061768e3de597, type: 2}
    actions: []
    music: {fileID: 0}
    sound: {fileID: 0}
  - text: Wait, why? I thought you wanted to help me change my past for the better?
      At least it sounded like that when we talked about it. If it gets too overwhelming,
      we can always come back here and get our mind off it all with work.
    alternativeText: 
    character: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 9c82936b944e581478f4d23ce326563a, type: 2}
    actions:
    - character: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 9c82936b944e581478f4d23ce326563a, type: 2}
      spriteIndex: 1
      type: 0
      position: {x: 0, y: 0}
      speed: 0
      targetScale: 0
    music: {fileID: 0}
    sound: {fileID: 0}
  - text: I think she noticed that I'm trying to distance myself all of a sudden.
      But it can't be helped, I can't let my feelings for her grow and risk her peace
      right now.
    alternativeText: 
    character: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 4849dc22c0fc77f45b58cdfcf9fc156e, type: 2}
    actions: []
    music: {fileID: 0}
    sound: {fileID: 0}
  - text: I think, it may be for the best if I quit my job right now. I want to focus
      on this. Maybe then I'll be able to help you change your past, but right now,
      it all just seems too unsure.
    alternativeText: 
    character: {fileID: 11400000, guid: d69d53562766de143bf061768e3de597, type: 2}
    actions: []
    music: {fileID: 0}
    sound: {fileID: 0}
  - text: "Why would you quit your job?! I thought you liked working in the company.
      Is it because I'm too strict sometimes? I'll try to change my ways of doing
      things, just\u2014"
    alternativeText: 
    character: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 9c82936b944e581478f4d23ce326563a, type: 2}
    actions:
    - character: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 9c82936b944e581478f4d23ce326563a, type: 2}
      spriteIndex: 1
      type: 0
      position: {x: 0, y: 0}
      speed: 0
      targetScale: 0
    music: {fileID: 0}
    sound: {fileID: 0}
  - text: No, that's not it. I always knew that you care about the employees and
      the company, and that you hide your kindness behind that cold attitude sometimes.
      I just don't want to put you in danger, and right now, I cannot ensure your
      safety when I don't even know what I truly am.
    alternativeText: 
    character: {fileID: 11400000, guid: d69d53562766de143bf061768e3de597, type: 2}
    actions: []
    music: {fileID: 0}
    sound: {fileID: 0}
  - text: The room falls silent for a few moments.
    alternativeText: 
    character: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 221cb615d975cab419307e866ebd5c5c, type: 2}
    actions: []
    music: {fileID: 0}
    sound: {fileID: 0}
  - text: "Why are they fighting?\u2026"
    alternativeText: 
    character: {fileID: 11400000, guid: a7b8c9d0e1f2031445566778899aabbc, type: 2}
    actions: []
    music: {fileID: 0}
    sound: {fileID: 0}
  - text: Dunno. A lover's quarrel perhaps?
    alternativeText: 
    character: {fileID: 11400000, guid: f5a7c9d1e2b34567890123456789abcd, type: 2}
    actions: []
    music: {fileID: 0}
    sound: {fileID: 0}
  - text: Shh. Don't disturb them.
    alternativeText: 
    character: {fileID: 11400000, guid: bbccddeeff00112233445566778899aa, type: 2}
    actions: []
    music: {fileID: 0}
    sound: {fileID: 0}
  - text: The three of them awkwardly exit the room.
    alternativeText: 
    character: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 221cb615d975cab419307e866ebd5c5c, type: 2}
    actions: []
    music: {fileID: 0}
    sound: {fileID: 0}
  - text: Scarlet sighs heavily.
    alternativeText: 
    character: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 221cb615d975cab419307e866ebd5c5c, type: 2}
    actions:
    - character: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 9c82936b944e581478f4d23ce326563a, type: 2}
      spriteIndex: 3
      type: 0
      position: {x: 0, y: 0}
      speed: 0
      targetScale: 0
    music: {fileID: 0}
    sound: {fileID: 0}
  - text: Fine, I'll let you temporarily leave work. But you must promise me to tell
      me, if there's anything I can do to help.
    alternativeText: 
    character: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 9c82936b944e581478f4d23ce326563a, type: 2}
    actions:
    - character: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 9c82936b944e581478f4d23ce326563a, type: 2}
      spriteIndex: 0
      type: 0
      position: {x: 0, y: 0}
      speed: 0
      targetScale: 0
    music: {fileID: 0}
    sound: {fileID: 0}
  - text: Thank you, Scarlet. I'm glad you understand.
    alternativeText: 
    character: {fileID: 11400000, guid: d69d53562766de143bf061768e3de597, type: 2}
    actions: []
    music: {fileID: 0}
    sound: {fileID: 0}
  - text: Scarlet looks at me with a saddened expression.
    alternativeText: 
    character: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 221cb615d975cab419307e866ebd5c5c, type: 2}
    actions:
    - character: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 9c82936b944e581478f4d23ce326563a, type: 2}
      spriteIndex: 3
      type: 0
      position: {x: 0, y: 0}
      speed: 0
      targetScale: 0
    music: {fileID: 0}
    sound: {fileID: 0}
  - text: If it's because I'm a vampire and you feel uncomfortable because of that,
      I understand. So please just tell me now, if that's the case.
    alternativeText: 
    character: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 9c82936b944e581478f4d23ce326563a, type: 2}
    actions:
    - character: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 9c82936b944e581478f4d23ce326563a, type: 2}
      spriteIndex: 3
      type: 0
      position: {x: 0, y: 0}
      speed: 0
      targetScale: 0
    music: {fileID: 0}
    sound: {fileID: 0}
  - text: Of course not, Scarlet. Those facts could never make me hate you, not when
      I've seen your warm sides.
    alternativeText: 
    character: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 4849dc22c0fc77f45b58cdfcf9fc156e, type: 2}
    actions: []
    music: {fileID: 0}
    sound: {fileID: 0}
  background: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 0a531472eb715104e8acc946d055c0dd, type: 3}
  nextScene: {fileID: 11400000, guid: ad0b0c0d0e0f101112131415161718ad, type: 2}
